sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Người dùng
    participant App as Flutter app
    participant Http as ApiService
    participant Proxy as FastAPI /uploads/presign
    participant Upload as UploadStore
    participant Storage as server/.uploads

    User->>App: chọn file lớn (groundwork)
    App->>Http: POST /uploads/presign(file_name, size_bytes)
    Http->>Proxy: request + X-App-Token
    Proxy->>Upload: generate_key + HMAC capability token
    Upload-->>Proxy: upload_uri + put_url + token + expiry
    Proxy-->>Http: presign response
    Http-->>App: capability data
    App->>Storage: PUT /uploads/{key}?token=...
    Storage-->>App: 201 Created
    App->>Http: GET /uploads/{key}/meta
    Http->>Proxy: request + X-App-Token
    Proxy->>Upload: meta(key)
    Upload-->>Proxy: metadata
    Proxy-->>Http: metadata
    Http-->>App: stored upload reference

    Note over User,Storage: Đường upload đã có ở proxy nhưng core import/review hiện tại chưa gọi nó.
